    { "type": "text", "id": "warning_body", "x": 140, "y": 664, "width": 800, "height": 40,
      "text": "Each factory implementation is the single place a whole family stays consistent -- there is no\ncode path that lets a caller ask one factory for one client and a different factory for another.",
      "originalText": "Each factory implementation is the single place a whole family stays consistent -- there is no\ncode path that lets a caller ask one factory for one client and a different factory for another.",
